	"Name": "Foraging Wild Honeycomb",
	"Author": "yourdorkbrains",
	"Description": "Pretty much you have a chance to get another forage item by exploring aka the Wild Honeycomb that has fallen out of a tree and just landed somewhere. \n<br />\n<br />You're able to collect the honeycomb and use it in a preserves jar (takes 4 honey combs wanted it to be realistic because it only has a little honey in it) to make Wild Honeycomb Honey and then you can use the honey in the keg to make Wild Honeycomb mead. \n<br />\n<br />\n<br />You are able to find 1-2 honeycombs in these locations each day between 0600-180000. You can edit these in the content file in the FTM folder.\n<br />1. Forest\n<br />2. Mountains\n<br />3. Backwoods\n<br />4. Bus Stop\n<br />5. Woods\n<br />\n<br />Only foragable in the Spring, Summer, &amp; Winter.\n<br />\n<br />Hope you enjoy! Please let me know what else you'd like to see foragable!",
